{"id":2,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield","HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"Exposure to sunlight adds to its strength. Sunlight also makes the bud on its back grow larger."},{"games":["Sword","LeafGreen","Blue","Red"],"text":"When the bulb on its back grows large, it appears to lose the ability to stand on its hind legs."},{"games":["Let’s Go, Eevee!","Let’s Go, Pikachu!"],"text":"The bud on its back grows by drawing energy. It gives off an aroma when it is ready to bloom."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"There is a bud on this Pokémon’s back. To support its weight, Ivysaur’s legs and trunk grow thick and strong. If it starts spending more time lying in the sunlight, it’s a sign that the bud will bloom into a large flower soon."},{"games":["Y","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"When the bud on its back starts swelling, a sweet aroma wafts to indicate the flower’s coming bloom."},{"games":["X","FireRed"],"text":"There is a plant bulb on its back. When it absorbs nutrients, the bulb is said to blossom into a large flower."},{"games":["SoulSilver","Silver"],"text":"If the bud on its back starts to smell sweet, it is evidence that the large flower will soon bloom."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"To support its bulb, IVYSAUR’s legs grow sturdy. If it spends more time lying in the sunlight, the bud will soon bloom into a large flower."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"The bulb on its back grows as it absorbs nutrients. The bulb gives off a pleasant aroma when it blooms."},{"games":["Yellow"],"text":"The bulb on its back grows by drawing energy. It gives off an aroma when it is ready to bloom."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Overgrow","hidden":false,"description":"Powers up Grass-type moves when the Pokémon's HP is low."},{"name":"Chlorophyll","hidden":true,"description":"Boosts the Pokémon's Speed stat in harsh sunlight."}],"eggGroups":["Monster","Grass"],"genderRate":1,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":